    {
      "id": "gen3191",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1782,
      "y": 1931,
      "width": 466,
      "height": 288.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2030186782,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1283884277,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781553231804,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "MARKET-VALUE PIPELINE  (ptComparison.js + ptMarketClient.js)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────\n0  Trust gate: empty listing.model → no fetch, verdict withheld\n1  Fetch enabled PT_SOURCES (default olx,standvirtual)\n     via Promise.allSettled (one source failing is skipped)\n2  comparisonCriteria: brand+model · year ±1 · km ±20 000\n3  comparableMatches (tolerant): model includes · fuel &\n     transmission exact · power ±20% · displacement ±15%\n4  dedupe: URL key OR price+normalised(model) fingerprint\n5  rejectPriceOutliers: Tukey IQR fence [Q1−1.5·IQR, Q3+1.5·IQR]\n6  estimateMarketValue →\n     mileage-regression (≥6 pts, neg slope, R²≥0.15, clamped)\n     → else median → else none\n─────────────────────────────────────────────\nOUTPUT → Import-Car PT fields:\n  medianaPortugalPrice  =  medianPriceEur\n  portugalEquivalentList =  sampleListings[]  (items w/ URL)\n  + marketValueEur · avgPriceEur · sampleSize ·\n    reliable (≥3) · lowConfidence (<5) · marketValueMethod\n  ⚠ minPortugalPrice / maxPortugalPrice: NOT IMPLEMENTED\n     (only internal IQR fence exists) — refactor target",
      "originalText": "MARKET-VALUE PIPELINE  (ptComparison.js + ptMarketClient.js)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────\n0  Trust gate: empty listing.model → no fetch, verdict withheld\n1  Fetch enabled PT_SOURCES (default olx,standvirtual)\n     via Promise.allSettled (one source failing is skipped)\n2  comparisonCriteria: brand+model · year ±1 · km ±20 000\n3  comparableMatches (tolerant): model includes · fuel &\n     transmission exact · power ±20% · displacement ±15%\n4  dedupe: URL key OR price+normalised(model) fingerprint\n5  rejectPriceOutliers: Tukey IQR fence [Q1−1.5·IQR, Q3+1.5·IQR]\n6  estimateMarketValue →\n     mileage-regression (≥6 pts, neg slope, R²≥0.15, clamped)\n     → else median → else none\n─────────────────────────────────────────────\nOUTPUT → Import-Car PT fields:\n  medianaPortugalPrice  =  medianPriceEur\n  portugalEquivalentList =  sampleListings[]  (items w/ URL)\n  + marketValueEur · avgPriceEur · sampleSize ·\n    reliable (≥3) · lowConfidence (<5) · marketValueMethod\n  ⚠ minPortugalPrice / maxPortugalPrice: NOT IMPLEMENTED\n     (only internal IQR fence exists) — refactor target",
      "containerId": null,
      "baseline": 284.75,
      "index": "z0147",
      "autoResize": true
    },
