      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "ISV = (Cylinder + Environmental)×(1−ageReduction)\n        + dieselParticleSurcharge,\n      then ×PHEV/hybrid regime,  then max(€100)\n\ndisplacementCm3 (L) · co2GKm (L)\nfuelType (L → gasoline|diesel table; EV ⇒ €0 exempt)\nemissionStandard (O→L, default WLTP)\nageYears (L) · particleEmissionsGKm (L, diesel €500)\ntables (S, via isvTableStore cache→baseline)\n\n⚠ combustion needs BOTH displacement + CO₂.\n   Missing → ISV stub unavailable, isv=null,\n   fields pushed to missing[] → INCOMPLETE",
      "originalText": "ISV = (Cylinder + Environmental)×(1−ageReduction)\n        + dieselParticleSurcharge,\n      then ×PHEV/hybrid regime,  then max(€100)\n\ndisplacementCm3 (L) · co2GKm (L)\nfuelType (L → gasoline|diesel table; EV ⇒ €0 exempt)\nemissionStandard (O→L, default WLTP)\nageYears (L) · particleEmissionsGKm (L, diesel €500)\ntables (S, via isvTableStore cache→baseline)\n\n⚠ combustion needs BOTH displacement + CO₂.\n   Missing → ISV stub unavailable, isv=null,\n   fields pushed to missing[] → INCOMPLETE",
      "containerId": null,
      "baseline": 174.75,
      "index": "z0153",
      "autoResize": true
    },
