      "fontSize": 11,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "'New means of transport': ≤6 months OR ≤6 000 km\n   ⇒ add 23% × priceEur on top (any fuel, incl. EV)\n\nmileageKm (L) · firstRegYear/Month (L)\nreferenceYear/Month (O = now) · ageYears (L)\npriceEur (L = VAT base) · rate 23% (S)\n\napplicable → vatEur ADDED to total\nsuspect (reg this yr, month unknown, age 0)\n   → null, NOT added, warns loudly\nNever causes incomplete",
      "originalText": "'New means of transport': ≤6 months OR ≤6 000 km\n   ⇒ add 23% × priceEur on top (any fuel, incl. EV)\n\nmileageKm (L) · firstRegYear/Month (L)\nreferenceYear/Month (O = now) · ageYears (L)\npriceEur (L = VAT base) · rate 23% (S)\n\napplicable → vatEur ADDED to total\nsuspect (reg this yr, month unknown, age 0)\n   → null, NOT added, warns loudly\nNever causes incomplete",
