      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "From CONFIG only — not the listing.\n\namount = cost_config row selected by\n  active_settings.activeTransportMethod\n  (e.g. transport.enclosed) → amount_eur\nlabel = transportRow.label\n\nno active method → missing 'transport.active_method'\nrow absent / enabled=false → missing <methodKey>\n   → INCOMPLETE",
      "originalText": "From CONFIG only — not the listing.\n\namount = cost_config row selected by\n  active_settings.activeTransportMethod\n  (e.g. transport.enclosed) → amount_eur\nlabel = transportRow.label\n\nno active method → missing 'transport.active_method'\nrow absent / enabled=false → missing <methodKey>\n   → INCOMPLETE",
