      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "total = germanPrice (L=priceEur)\n        + ISV + Transport(C)\n        + Legalisation(C) + vatAdd\n\nvatAdd = vat.vatEur only if applicable, else 0\nIUC is EXCLUDED from the total.\n\nincomplete iff missing.length>0 → total = NULL\nmissingConfig ∈ { listing.displacementCm3,\n  listing.co2GKm, transport.active_method,\n  <transportKey>, legalisation.* }",
      "originalText": "total = germanPrice (L=priceEur)\n        + ISV + Transport(C)\n        + Legalisation(C) + vatAdd\n\nvatAdd = vat.vatEur only if applicable, else 0\nIUC is EXCLUDED from the total.\n\nincomplete iff missing.length>0 → total = NULL\nmissingConfig ∈ { listing.displacementCm3,\n  listing.co2GKm, transport.active_method,\n  <transportKey>, legalisation.* }",
      "containerId": null,
