      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "IUC = (cylinder + co2 + additionalCo2)\n        × yearCoefficient + dieselSurcharge\n\ndisplacementCm3 (L) · co2GKm (L)\nemissionStandard (O→L) · firstRegYear (L)\nfuelType (L; EV ⇒ €0 exempt)\nbrackets/coefficients (S, OE2026)\n\nComputed unconditionally; NEVER added to total.\nInformational, isolated from completeness.",
      "originalText": "IUC = (cylinder + co2 + additionalCo2)\n        × yearCoefficient + dieselSurcharge\n\ndisplacementCm3 (L) · co2GKm (L)\nemissionStandard (O→L) · firstRegYear (L)\nfuelType (L; EV ⇒ €0 exempt)\nbrackets/coefficients (S, OE2026)\n\nComputed unconditionally; NEVER added to total.\nInformational, isolated from completeness.",
      "containerId": null,
      "baseline": 133.5,
      "index": "z0168",
      "autoResize": true
    },
