      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "ref = marketValueEur ?? avgPriceEur\n\nsavingEur = ref − totalLandedCostEur\nwith resaleHaircutPct →\n  estimatedResaleEur = ref×(1−haircut)\n  marginEur / marginPct\n\nWITHHELD if incomplete OR ref=null\n   OR comparison.reliable === false",
      "originalText": "ref = marketValueEur ?? avgPriceEur\n\nsavingEur = ref − totalLandedCostEur\nwith resaleHaircutPct →\n  estimatedResaleEur = ref×(1−haircut)\n  marginEur / marginPct\n\nWITHHELD if incomplete OR ref=null\n   OR comparison.reliable === false",
      "containerId": null,
      "baseline": 119.75,
      "index": "z0171",
      "autoResize": true
