    {
      "id": "gen3656",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 3713,
      "width": 956,
      "height": 151.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1539718047,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 793415542,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781553231804,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "MECHANISM   (apifySearch.js + apifyClient.js)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────\n1  Fan out ONE actor per enabled site (apify_sites default\n     mobilede, autoscout24, autouncle) — Promise.allSettled\n2  sites/<site>.buildInput maps your filters → actor input,\n     capped at APIFY_MAX_PER_SITE  (default 50 / site)\n3  runActor → POST /v2/acts/<actor>/run-sync-get-\n     dataset-items  (synchronous, no polling) ·\n     optional Apify Proxy (apify_use_proxy, default on)\n4  map → normalized Car · defensive post-filter · dedupe ·\n     cache 6h in SQLite listings_cache  (repeat = free)",
      "originalText": "MECHANISM   (apifySearch.js + apifyClient.js)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────\n1  Fan out ONE actor per enabled site (apify_sites default\n     mobilede, autoscout24, autouncle) — Promise.allSettled\n2  sites/<site>.buildInput maps your filters → actor input,\n     capped at APIFY_MAX_PER_SITE  (default 50 / site)\n3  runActor → POST /v2/acts/<actor>/run-sync-get-\n     dataset-items  (synchronous, no polling) ·\n     optional Apify Proxy (apify_use_proxy, default on)\n4  map → normalized Car · defensive post-filter · dedupe ·\n     cache 6h in SQLite listings_cache  (repeat = free)",
      "containerId": null,
      "baseline": 147.25,
      "index": "z0178",
      "autoResize": true
    },
