    {
      "id": "gen4826",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 4429,
      "width": 1156,
      "height": 220.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1968203409,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1221900904,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781553231804,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "BUILD STEPS   (mobile.de = primary; AS24 / OLX / Standvirtual already keyless)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n0  SPIKE — confirm /consumer/api/search/srp returns JSON with browser headers\n     (UA + Accept: application/json + Accept-Language); may need a cookie-warmup\n     GET on www.mobile.de first to pass Akamai\n1  Refactor — lift the duplicated extractNextData() into a shared util (direct/nextData.js)\n2  direct/mobilede.js — HEADERS · buildSearchUrl(filters) · fetchPage → res.json() ·\n     paginate to maxResults · mapListing → canonical Car (reuse normalize.js + germanInt) ·\n     brand-only fallback · fetchImpl injection seam for tests\n3  Wire into directSearch.js searchListingsDirect Promise.allSettled +\n     searchMobiledeCached (own cache key, 6h TTL)\n4  If SRP item lacks CO₂ / displacement → extend enrichMissingCo2 gate\n     (today source==='autoscout24' only) + add a mobile.de detail fetcher\n5  config.js getDirectConfig() — add mobile.de keys + a direct_sites toggle\n6  Add AbortController timeout + small retry/backoff  (direct path has NONE today)\n7  Fixture tests — inject a fake fetchImpl with a saved JSON response",
      "originalText": "BUILD STEPS   (mobile.de = primary; AS24 / OLX / Standvirtual already keyless)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n0  SPIKE — confirm /consumer/api/search/srp returns JSON with browser headers\n     (UA + Accept: application/json + Accept-Language); may need a cookie-warmup\n     GET on www.mobile.de first to pass Akamai\n1  Refactor — lift the duplicated extractNextData() into a shared util (direct/nextData.js)\n2  direct/mobilede.js — HEADERS · buildSearchUrl(filters) · fetchPage → res.json() ·\n     paginate to maxResults · mapListing → canonical Car (reuse normalize.js + germanInt) ·\n     brand-only fallback · fetchImpl injection seam for tests\n3  Wire into directSearch.js searchListingsDirect Promise.allSettled +\n     searchMobiledeCached (own cache key, 6h TTL)\n4  If SRP item lacks CO₂ / displacement → extend enrichMissingCo2 gate\n     (today source==='autoscout24' only) + add a mobile.de detail fetcher\n5  config.js getDirectConfig() — add mobile.de keys + a direct_sites toggle\n6  Add AbortController timeout + small retry/backoff  (direct path has NONE today)\n7  Fixture tests — inject a fake fetchImpl with a saved JSON response",
      "containerId": null,
      "baseline": 216.0,
      "index": "z0256",
      "autoResize": true
    },
