      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "CAVEATS & RISKS\n──────────────────────────────\n· robots.txt: consumer API is allowed; suchen.mobile.de\n   + /auto-inserat/ are DISALLOWED → use the API only,\n   never the HTML SRP page\n· mobile.de may still gate the API behind Akamai cookies.\n   If the spike can't get JSON keyless, KEEP the official\n   API (B2B) + Apify as fallbacks — don't rip them out\n· direct path has no proxy → heavy use may need a\n   residential proxy (which re-creates Apify's value/cost)\n· AutoUncle aggregates AS24/mobile.de → little new data\n   → recommend skipping it in direct mode",
      "originalText": "CAVEATS & RISKS\n──────────────────────────────\n· robots.txt: consumer API is allowed; suchen.mobile.de\n   + /auto-inserat/ are DISALLOWED → use the API only,\n   never the HTML SRP page\n· mobile.de may still gate the API behind Akamai cookies.\n   If the spike can't get JSON keyless, KEEP the official\n   API (B2B) + Apify as fallbacks — don't rip them out\n· direct path has no proxy → heavy use may need a\n   residential proxy (which re-creates Apify's value/cost)\n· AutoUncle aggregates AS24/mobile.de → little new data\n   → recommend skipping it in direct mode",
      "containerId": null,
      "baseline": 161.0,
      "index": "z0258",
      "autoResize": true
    },
